    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like a lot of work to prove i matter. all this effort to \"find my place\" or talk to people who won't even look me in the eye. sometimes i think the idea that i \"matter\" is just something people say to be nice. if you really look at the math of it, i'm just a tiny, insignificant speck. maybe it is more peaceful to just accept that i don't belong here and stop fighting it.",
